#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:18
msgid "Right-Click Menus"
msgstr "Kontextové ponuky (pravé tlačidlo myši)"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:22
msgid "Clip in Timeline"
msgstr "Klip v časovej osi"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:24
msgid ""
"This is the context menu that appears when you right-click on a clip in the "
"timeline.  A different menu appears if you click in empty space in the "
"timeline."
msgstr ""
"Toto je kontextová ponuka, ktorá sa zobrazí po kliknutí pravým tlačidlom "
"myši na klip v časovej osi. Iná ponuka sa zobrazí, ak kliknete na prázdne "
"miesto v časovej osi."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:28
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Copy` will copy the clip and selected clips to the "
#| "clipboard."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Copy` will copy the clip and selected clips to the clipboard."
msgstr ":menuselection:`Kopírovať` skopíruje klip a vybrané klipy do schránky."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duplicate Clip` will create a copy of a single selected clip even "
"inside a group on the respective track (including all effects and keyframes) "
"and place it on the timeline after the selected clip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:32
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Paste Effects` will paste only the effects of the last "
#| "copied clip to the selected clip.  See :ref:`edit_paste_effects`."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Paste Effects` will paste only the effects of the last copied "
"clip to the selected clip.  See :ref:`edit_paste_effects`."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Vložiť efekty` vloží iba efekty naposledy skopírovaného "
"klipu do vybraného klipu. Pozri :ref:`edit_paste_effects`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:34
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Delete Effects` will remove all effects from the selected "
#| "clip."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Remove Effects` will remove all effects from the selected clip."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Vymazať efekty` odstráni všetky efekty z vybraného klipu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:36
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ":menuselection:`Group Clips` - see :ref:`grouping`"
msgid ":guilabel:`Group Clips` - see :ref:`grouping`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Zoskupiť klipy` – pozri :ref:`grouping`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:38
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ":menuselection:`Ungroup Clips` - see :ref:`grouping`"
msgid ":guilabel:`Ungroup Clips` - see :ref:`grouping`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Oddeliť klipy` – pozri :ref:`grouping`"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:44
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Edit Duration` - will open the Duration Dialog and will "
#| "allow you to adjust the position of the clip in the timeline, what time "
#| "point of the source clip to start on the timeline, the duration of the "
#| "clip, and what time point of the source clip to end on the timeline. Note "
#| "that Kdenlive will automatically adjust co-related values."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Edit Duration` - will open the Duration Dialog and will allow you "
"to adjust the position of the clip in the timeline, what time point of the "
"source clip to start on the timeline, the duration of the clip, and what "
"time point of the source clip to end on the timeline. Note that Kdenlive "
"will automatically adjust co-related values."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Upraviť trvanie` – otvorí dialóg Trvanie a umožní vám "
"upraviť polohu klipu v časovej osi, časový bod zdrojového klipu, od ktorého "
"sa má začať na časovej osi, trvanie klipu a časový bod zdrojového klipu, na "
"ktorom má skončiť na časovej osi. Upozorňujeme, že Kdenlive automaticky "
"upraví súvisiace hodnoty."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:52
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Restore audio` will add any audio track that is part of "
#| "the original clip to the timeline"
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Restore audio` will add any audio track that is part of the "
"original clip to the timeline"
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Obnoviť zvuk` pridá do časovej osi akúkoľvek zvukovú stopu, "
"ktorá je súčasťou pôvodného klipu"

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:56
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Disable clip` will disable the clip so it will not render "
#| "in the project monitor or in a final video render. To disable the video "
#| "or audio part of an A/V clip you have to un-group the A/V clip, disable "
#| "the video or audio part and group the A/V clip again."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Disable clip` will disable the clip so it will not render in the "
"project monitor or in a final video render. To disable the video or audio "
"part of an A/V clip you have to un-group the A/V clip, disable the video or "
"audio part and group the A/V clip again."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Zakázať klip` zakáže klip, takže sa nebude renderovať v "
"monitore projektu ani pri finálnom renderovaní videa. Ak chcete zakázať "
"video alebo zvukovú časť klipu A/V, musíte oddeliť klip A/V, zakázať video "
"alebo zvukovú časť a klip A/V opäť zoskupiť."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:60
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Delete Selected Item` will delete the item you have "
#| "selected. Add to the selection: Holding down :kbd:`Shift` and click on "
#| "additional items. :menuselection:`Timeline --> Current track --> Remove "
#| "All Clips After Cursor` handles AV clips as 1 element, doesn't matter on "
#| "which track they are. This function is only in the Timeline menu "
#| "available this to avoid clutter."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delete Selected Item` will delete the item you have selected. Add "
"to the selection: Holding down :kbd:`Shift` and click on additional items. :"
"menuselection:`Timeline --> Current track --> Remove All Clips After Cursor` "
"handles AV clips as 1 element, doesn't matter on which track they are. This "
"function is only in the Timeline menu available this to avoid clutter."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Vymazať vybraný prvok` vymaže vybraný prvok. Pridanie do "
"výberu: podržte :kbd:`Shift` a kliknite na ďalšie prvky. :menuselection:"
"`Časová os --> Aktuálna stopa --> Odstrániť všetky klipy za kurzorom` "
"spracováva AV klipy ako 1 prvok, nezáleží na tom, na ktorej stope sa "
"nachádzajú. Táto funkcia je dostupná iba v ponuke Časová os, aby sa predišlo "
"neporiadku."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:66
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Extract clip` will remove the clip from the timeline and "
#| "the space it occupied."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extract clip` will remove the clip from the timeline and the "
"space it occupied."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Extrahovať klip` odstráni klip z časovej osi aj priestor, "
"ktorý zaberá."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Replace with Bin Selection` will replace the selected clip with "
"the clip that is selected in the project bin. A dialog box appears for "
"confirming the replacement. If no clip is selected in the project bin, it "
"allows you to open the dialog for :guilabel:`Import New Clip`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Save Clip Part to Bin` saves a specific cut section from the "
"timeline back into your Project Bin as an organized sub-clip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create Sequence from Selection` will create a new sequence from "
"selected clips in the timeline. You need to select at least two clips. The "
"selected clips will be replaced by the new created sequence. Details see :"
"ref:`Create_nested_sequence`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Copy Selection to New Sequence` will copy the selected clips from "
"the timeline to a new sequence. You need to select at least two clips."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:84
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The markers sub-menu allows you to add, edit and remove markers from your "
#| "clips that are displayed on the timeline.  These markers will move with "
#| "the clips.  See :ref:`markers`."
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Markers` sub-menu allows you to add, edit and remove markers "
"from your clips that are displayed on the timeline.  These markers will move "
"with the clips.  See :ref:`markers`."
msgstr ""
"Podnáponuka záložiek umožňuje pridávať, upravovať a odstraňovať záložky z "
"vašich klipov zobrazených v časovej osi. Tieto záložky sa budú pohybovať "
"spolu s klipmi. Pozri :ref:`markers`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:96
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The :menuselection:`Align to Reference` sub-menu allows you to set either "
#| "audio or SMPTE-esque timecode to a reference. This is useful if two or "
#| "more cameras recorded the same scene simultaneously."
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Align to Reference` sub-menu allows you to set either audio "
"or SMPTE-esque timecode to a reference. This is useful if two or more "
"cameras recorded the same scene simultaneously. Or when you use it within :"
"ref:`Multicam editing <multicam_tool>`."
msgstr ""
"Podnáponuka :menuselection:`Zarovnať podľa referencie` umožňuje nastaviť ako "
"referenciu buď zvuk, alebo časový kód SMPTE. Je to užitočné, ak dve alebo "
"viac kamier súčasne nahrávalo rovnakú scénu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:98
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Set Audio Reference` and :menuselection:`Align Audio to "
#| "Reference` are used to align clips on different tracks in the timeline "
#| "based on the audio in the tracks. **Kdenlive** can use the almost "
#| "identical audio track to align the two clips."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Set Audio Reference` and :guilabel:`Align Audio to Reference` are "
"used to align clips on different tracks in the timeline based on the audio "
"in the tracks. **Kdenlive** can use the almost identical audio track to "
"align the two clips."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Nastaviť zvukovú referenciu` a :menuselection:`Zarovnať zvuk "
"podľa referencie` sa používajú na zarovnanie klipov na rôznych stopách v "
"časovej osi na základe zvuku v stopách. **Kdenlive** môže na zarovnanie "
"dvoch klipov využiť takmer identickú zvukovú stopu."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:100
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":menuselection:`Set Timecode Reference` and :menuselection:`Align "
#| "Timecode to Reference` are used to align clips on different tracks in the "
#| "timeline based on the SMPTE-esque timecode in the tracks."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Set Timecode Reference` and :guilabel:`Align Timecode to "
"Reference` are used to align clips on different tracks in the timeline based "
"on the SMPTE-esque timecode in the tracks."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Nastaviť referenciu časového kódu` a :menuselection:"
"`Zarovnať časový kód podľa referencie` sa používajú na zarovnanie klipov na "
"rôznych stopách v časovej osi na základe časového kódu SMPTE v stopách."

